  "description": "MiniMax M3.1 Flash is the flash successor in the MiniMax M3 family, released 2026-10-19. It is a multimodal reasoning model with a 1M-token context window, native image and video input, and text output. Thinking is always on (cannot be disabled) with effort levels low/medium/high/xhigh/max (default max). Described as open-weight with weights to be released later; no Hugging Face checkpoint is available yet. The anonymous \"Space Bunny\" model was an early version. Available via the MiniMax API (Anthropic-compatible and OpenAI-compatible endpoints), M Plan, and MiniMax Code.",
